-- Checked facts about the Kuratowski pair (x, y) and its bound 𝒫(𝒫(A ∪ B)).
-- Elaborated before the module graph, after Aliases and Nat.
-- Part of the Grace17 proof assistant for mathematics based on set theory.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Olney Passmore.
